      "comments": [
        "Time slots have no origin in the model. Seat Availability.timeSlot and .reservationDate are mapped to Reservation Made.*, but the slot grid (18:00 / 20:00 / 22:00) exists before anyone books - a slot with zero reservations must still show a row, and today nothing on the board creates one. Is the slot list fixed configuration (then say so in a note and change the mapping to derived:), or is there a missing concept that belongs next to 'seats' in Managing Tables?"
      ]
